'''Barking Bay''' (ワンワン湾, ''Wan Wan-wan'', '''Woof Woof Bay''') is the 5th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 54th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|version 7.2]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A relatively easy sub-chapter: the first 2 stages are a complete joke while the rest are fairly easy even without [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]]. The only exception is [[Young Cuttlefish]], which can be quite challenging.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Loris]]: A [[Tackey]]-like [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy with decent health, low damage and speed, several knockbacks, a 100% chance of applying [[Curse|curse]] and very long effective range (500~800).

